Oh, I completely agree. Adding older videos, especially the sarcastic parodies, early YouTube debates, and vintage documentaries, gives your AI a much better grasp of how these topics have evolved in pop culture and comedy over time. Sarcasm is one of the hardest things for an AI to master, so feeding it stand-up comedy and musical parodies is a brilliant move.

Here is a curated list of older, heavily sarcastic, and vintage documentary YouTube videos to add to your dataset.

